# Third-Party Library Credits

The following third-party libraries and frameworks are utilized in the Mars Vista Rover App. We gratefully acknowledge the contributions of these open-source projects:

## 1. Networking & Data Serialization
* **Retrofit, OkHttp & Logging Interceptor** (by Square)
  * HTTP client for the Mars Vista REST API.

* **Gson** (by Google)
  * JSON serialization and deserialization mapping responses to Kotlin DTO models.

## 2. Image Loading
* **Coil Compose** (by Coil Contributors)
  * Asynchronous image loading, memory/disk caching, and responsive grid image rendering.

## 3. Dependency Injection
* **Hilt & Dagger** (by Google)
  * Dependency injection framework.
